abstract: >
  genesis-os is the central Python runtime of the GenesisAeon ecosystem: a
  self-reflecting, entropy-governed framework implementing the Unified
  Lagrangian formalism L = T − V + Φ(H) + Γ(C,R,E,P), UTAC-Logistic ODE,
  CREP tensor evaluation, live cosmic-web emergence simulation, Dash web GUI,
  Mandala visualisation, and orchestration across 40+ domain packages.
  Includes AFET+Landauer thermodynamic consistency, Mirror Machine,
  Sigillin semantic anchors, FraktalRun phase-space engine, and OPA-based
  ethics governance. Python 3.10+.

